  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "74",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 74"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "74",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "cl"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Psalm 74",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "tl"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "maskil",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of Asaph.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O God, why have you rejected us forever?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Why does your anger smolder against the sheep of your pasture?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember the nation you purchased long ago,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the people of your inheritance, whom you redeemed—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mount Zion, where you dwelt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn your steps toward these everlasting ruins,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "all this destruction the enemy has brought on the sanctuary.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your foes roared in the place where you met with us;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they set up their standards as signs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They behaved like men wielding axes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to cut through a thicket of trees.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They smashed all the carved paneling",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "with their axes and hatchets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They burned your sanctuary to the ground;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they defiled the dwelling place of your Name.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said in their hearts, \"We will crush them completely!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "They burned every place where God was worshiped in the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We are given no signs from God;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "no prophets are left,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and none of us knows how long this will be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How long will the enemy mock you, God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Will the foe revile your name forever?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why do you hold back your hand, your right hand?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Take it from the folds of your garment and destroy them!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God is my King from long ago;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he brings salvation on the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was you who split open the sea by your power;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you broke the heads of the monster in the waters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was you who crushed the heads of Leviathan",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and gave it as food to the creatures of the desert.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was you who opened up springs and streams;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you dried up the ever-flowing rivers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The day is yours, and yours also the night;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you established the sun and moon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was you who set all the boundaries of the earth;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 74:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you made both summer and winter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember how the enemy has mocked you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
